      "     |      See :ref:`seedsequence-spawn` for additional notes on spawning\n",
      "     |      children.  Some bit generators also implement ``jumped``\n",
      "     |      as a different approach for creating independent streams.\n",
      "     |\n",
      "     |      .. versionadded:: 1.25.0\n",
      "     |\n",
